<title>USA: Lehman declines to comment on Chase rumors.</title>
<headline>Lehman declines to comment on Chase rumors.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokesman for Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc declined to comment Wednesday on market speculation that the brokerage may be acquired by Chase Manhattan Corp.</p>
<p>In afternoon NYSE trade, Lehman shares were up 5-1/16 to 50-1/4, while Chase shares rose 1-1/16 to 106-3/16.</p>
